(3,0,'Pressure Gauge Accessories','pressure-gauge-accessories','https://www.hbfittings.net/Content/uploads/2021806904/20210618094714fc7ea8c7bc62444280951f16881dd15d.jpg','Gauge cocks, test plugs, pressure snubbers, adapters and syphon tubes.',1,30,1,NOW(3),NOW(3)),
